			"styles": "\n\t/* an escape does not end an ident, so the feature name lowercases across it */\n\t@media (a\\42 c: 1px) {\n\t\td {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t/* a custom-media name is case-sensitive, so the whole run survives */\n\t@media (--A\\42 C: 1px) {\n\t\td {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t@media (--MIN\\-WIDTH: 1px) {\n\t\td {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n",
